A([Start]) --> B[/Enter student's name/]
B --> C[/Enter grade/]
C --> D {Is grade 0-100?}

D -->|No| E[Show Invalid Grade]
E --> F[enter grade again]
F --> D

D --> |Yes| G{Grade >= 90?}

G --> |Yes| H[Grade = A]
G --> |No| I{Grade >= 80?}

I --> |Yes| J[Grade = B]
I --> |No| K{Grade >= 70?}

K --> |Yes|  L[Grade = C]
K --> |No| M{Grade >= 60?}

M --> |Yes| N[Grade = D]
M --> |No| O[Grade = F]

H --> P[Display Letter Grade]
J --> P
L --> P
N --> P
O --> P

P --> Q{Did student pass?}

Q -->|Yes| R[Display Passed]
Q --> |No| S[Display Failed

R --> T([End])
S =--> T
